            Fabric texture: Detect and replicate the exact fabric texture from the reference image.
            Lighting: Bright indoor lighting, softbox lighting effect, no dark shadows, white balance.
            Background: Modern minimalist bedroom, white and wood tones, clean.
            Quality: 2k resolution, razor-sharp focus, fair skin tones, authentic color grading, no filters, high fidelity masterpiece, extremely detailed.
            Negative prompt: Dark skin, tanned skin, profile view, back view, low light, blurry, plastic skin, distorted face, sad face.`;

            const response = await ai.models.generateContent({
                model: 'gemini-2.5-flash-image',
                contents: {
                    parts: [
                        fileToPart(base64Image, mimeType),
                        { text: prompt }
                    ]
                }
            });

            if(response.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts) {
                for (const part of response.candidates[0].content.parts) {
                    if (part.inlineData && part.inlineData.data) {
                        results.push(part.inlineData.data);
                        break; 
                    }
                }
            }
        } catch (e) {
            console.error(`Error generating selfie image ${i+1}:`, e);
        }
    }

    if (results.length === 0) {
        throw new Error("Không thể tạo ảnh selfie. Vui lòng thử lại.");
    }
    return results;
}

export const generateLookbookImages = async (base64Image: string, mimeType: string, options: LookbookOptions): Promise<LookbookResult[]> => {
    const results: LookbookResult[] = [];
    const genderEn = options.gender === 'Nam' ? 'male' : 'female';

    // Determine ethnicity specific prompt details
    let ethnicityPrompt = "";
    const beautyTerms = options.gender === 'Nam' ? 'handsome, attractive face' : 'beautiful, pretty face';

    if (options.ethnicity === 'Hàn Quốc') {
        ethnicityPrompt = "Korean (K-pop idol aesthetic, pale white skin, trendy hairstyle)";
    } else {
        ethnicityPrompt = "Vietnamese (distinctive Vietnamese Asian features, fair white skin, glowing skin)";
    }

    for(let i=0; i<options.numberOfImages; i++) {
        try {
            // Map the pose to English description while keeping strict "Front facing" constraint
            const poseDescription = options.pose === 'Dáng đi' 
                ? 'Walking forward towards the camera, dynamic movement' 
                : 'Standing confident upright, power pose';

            // Enhanced Lookbook Prompt - Strict constraints on skin tone, pose, and smile
            const prompt = `Fashion Lookbook Photography. A ${options.age} year old ${ethnicityPrompt} ${genderEn} model (${beautyTerms}, smiling gently, happy expression, warm vibes) wearing this ${options.clothingType}.
            Pose: ${poseDescription}, Front facing, looking directly at camera.
            Theme: ${options.theme}.
            Additional details: ${options.additionalPrompt || 'None'}.
            Lighting: Bright airy lighting, sunlight, high-key, sharp contrast, clear colors.
            Aspect Ratio: ${options.aspectRatio}.
            Quality: 2k resolution, ultra-sharp focus, highly detailed texture, fair white skin texture, photorealistic masterpiece, 8k uhd, magazine quality.`;

             const response = await ai.models.generateContent({
                model: 'gemini-2.5-flash-image',
                contents: {
                    parts: [
                        fileToPart(base64Image, mimeType),
                        { text: prompt }
                    ]
                }
            });

            let imageUrl = "";
            if(response.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts) {
                for (const part of response.candidates[0].content.parts) {
                    if (part.inlineData && part.inlineData.data) {
                        imageUrl = `data:image/jpeg;base64,${part.inlineData.data}`;
                        break; 
                    }
                }
            }

            if (imageUrl) {
                 let videoPrompt = "";
                 if (options.generateVideo) {
                     const videoAction = options.pose === 'Dáng đi' ? 'Walking confidently towards camera' : 'Standing and posing';
                     videoPrompt = `Cinematic video. A beautiful ${ethnicityPrompt} ${genderEn} model with fair skin wearing ${options.clothingType}, standing in ${options.theme}. 
                     Action: ${videoAction}, Looking directly at camera, smiling gently, happy expression, bright lighting, front view.
                     Style: High fashion, 4k resolution, shallow depth of field, slow motion.`;
                 }
                 results.push({ imageUrl, videoPrompt });
            }

        } catch (e) {
            console.error(`Error generating lookbook image ${i+1}:`, e);
        }
    }

    if (results.length === 0) {
        throw new Error("Không thể tạo ảnh Lookbook. Vui lòng thử lại.");
    }
    return results;
}

