            Additional details: ${options.additionalPrompt || 'None'}.
            Lighting: Bright airy lighting, sunlight, high-key, sharp contrast, clear colors.
            Aspect Ratio: ${options.aspectRatio}.
            Quality: 2k resolution, ultra-sharp focus, highly detailed texture, fair white skin texture, photorealistic masterpiece, 8k uhd, magazine quality.`;

             const response = await ai.models.generateContent({
                model,
                contents: {
                    parts: [
                        fileToPart(base64Image, mimeType),
                        { text: prompt }
                    ]
                }
            });

            let imageUrl = "";
            if(response.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts) {
                for (const part of response.candidates[0].content.parts) {
                    if (part.inlineData && part.inlineData.data) {
                        imageUrl = `data:image/jpeg;base64,${part.inlineData.data}`;
                        break; 
                    }
                }
            }

            if (imageUrl) {
                 let videoPrompt = "";
                 if (options.generateVideo) {
                     let actionDescription = "";
                     let cameraDescription = "";

                     if (options.pose === 'Dáng đi') {
                         // Walking logic: Tracking shot, keep in frame
                         actionDescription = "walking forward casually like strolling, confident gait";
                         cameraDescription = "Camera performs a smooth tracking shot (dolly out) moving backwards at the exact same speed as the model. The model must remain perfectly framed (full body visible, head to toe) at all times. No zooming, no cuts, continuous one-shot.";
                     } else {
                         // Standing logic: Static camera, subtle poses
                         actionDescription = "standing at a fixed location, making subtle poses to showcase the outfit, taking small subtle steps in place or shifting weight without moving away. No talking";
                         cameraDescription = "Static camera (tripod shot), absolutely no camera movement or zooming. The frame is fixed and stable. Continuous one-shot.";
                     }

                     videoPrompt = `Cinematic one-shot video (no cuts). A beautiful ${ethnicityPrompt} ${genderEn} model with fair skin wearing ${options.clothingType}, located in ${options.theme}. 
                     Action: The model is ${actionDescription}. Looking directly at camera, smiling gently, happy expression.
                     Camera: ${cameraDescription}
                     Style: High fashion, 4k resolution, shallow depth of field, slow motion, photorealistic.`;
                 }
                 results.push({ imageUrl, videoPrompt });
            }

        } catch (e) {
            console.error(`Error generating lookbook image ${i+1}:`, e);
        }
    }

    if (results.length === 0) {
        throw new Error("Không thể tạo ảnh Lookbook. Vui lòng thử lại.");
    }
    return results;
}

export const enhanceImage = async (base64Image: string, mimeType: string, options: EnhanceOptions, modelLevel: ModelLevel): Promise<string> => {
    try {
        const model = getImageModel(modelLevel);
        let promptInstructions = "";
        if (options.upscale) promptInstructions += "Upscale to high resolution (2K), improve clarity and definition. ";
        if (options.sharpen) promptInstructions += "Sharpen details, fix softness or blur, enhance focus. ";
        if (options.removeWatermark) promptInstructions += "Remove any watermarks, text, or logos overlaid on the image, filling the area naturally. ";

        const prompt = `Enhance this image based on the following instructions: ${promptInstructions}. 
        General Quality: 2k resolution, ultra-sharp focus, natural bright colors, photorealistic, high fidelity. Maintain the original subject identity and clothing details exactly.`;

        const response = await ai.models.generateContent({
            model,
            contents: {
                parts: [
                    fileToPart(base64Image, mimeType),
                    { text: prompt }
                ]
            }
        });

        if(response.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts) {
            for (const part of response.candidates[0].content.parts) {
                if (part.inlineData && part.inlineData.data) {
                    return part.inlineData.data;
                }
            }
        }
        throw new Error("No image returned from enhancement model.");
    } catch (e) {
        console.error("Enhance Image Error", e);
        throw new Error("Không thể nâng cấp ảnh. Vui lòng thử lại.");
    }
}

export const generateReviewScript = async (options: ReviewScriptOptions, modelLevel: ModelLevel): Promise<ReviewScriptResult> => {
    try {
        const model = getTextModel(modelLevel);
        const prompt = `Write a short, catchy 3-sentence video review script (TikTok/Shorts style) for this product.
        Product Info: ${options.productInfo}.
        Type: ${options.scriptType}.
        Accent/Regional Dialect: ${options.accent} (Use authentic local vocabulary: e.g., 'đỉnh chóp', 'nhức nách', 'chất lừ', 'giá rổ' for North; 'bao đẹp', 'xịn sò', 'cưng xỉu', 'giá hạt dẻ' for South).
        Structure:
        1. Hook (Capture attention in 2 seconds)
        2. Body (Key benefit/feature in 1 sentence)
        3. CTA (Call to action)

        Output JSON format: { "hook": "...", "body": "...", "cta": "..." }`;

        const response = await ai.models.generateContent({
            model,
            contents: { text: prompt },
            config: {
                 responseMimeType: "application/json"
            }
        });

        const text = response.text || "{}";
